      "updated": 1793552400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Manual rollback: DEPLOY_TAG + ACK_SCHEMA_COMPATIBLE=true\nUse the target release's saved deployment script, Compose configuration and image tags.\nThe target images must support the current schema. Never reverse migrations automatically.\nRestoring data is a separate reviewed recovery operation; test backups in an isolated PostgreSQL 16 database.",
      "originalText": "Manual rollback: DEPLOY_TAG + ACK_SCHEMA_COMPATIBLE=true\nUse the target release's saved deployment script, Compose configuration and image tags.\nThe target images must support the current schema. Never reverse migrations automatically.\nRestoring data is a separate reviewed recovery operation; test backups in an isolated PostgreSQL 16 database.",
